    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Mid-to-senior digital designer / art director / creative developer; ECAL-trained, ex-parc, now runs his own Paris studio JeanReneJean (an art-direction and creative studio building websites, visual identities and digital strategies). Strong fashion/culture web work: System Magazine, Galerie Kreo, Marine Serre x Selfridges, Momus, LN-CC, Converse. Autonomy 4: leads client projects end-to-end and has his own dev team, though the studio is relatively new. From Jonathan call notes (he spoke to Jean for Pentagram): Jean likes building tools not just delivering final assets (website is a communication tool), wants to work across the whole thing rather than hand over an identity at the end, pitches bringing emotion to the client and automating brand/social assets, happy to be part of the wider effort. Says he has a team that develops (frameworks not confirmed); works via wireframing and design explorations. Day rate not captured (Jonathan did not ask). Work images are screenshots of his interactive WebGL portfolio.",
